cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the accompanying article
  (preferred-citation) and the software itself, using the metadata from this file.
type: software
title: "COΦ (cophi): COmpiling PHotonics into dIgital quantum circuits"
abstract: >-
  Compiler for translating Blackbird quantum optics programs into qubit-based
  OpenQASM circuits via truncated Fock space encoding. Photon-number states of
  each optical mode are encoded in binary across qubits, so continuous-variable
  circuits (squeezing, displacement, phase shift, beam splitter) can be run on
  gate-based simulators and hardware.
